column8:
I love it as well, and would hate to do without it, but it does come with it&#x27;s own warts.  Such as this:<p><pre><code>    use Data::Dumper;
    my %h;
    if ( $h{foo}{bar}{baz} ) { say &quot;Never happens&quot;; }
    say Dumper \%h;
</code></pre>
And you get this:<p><pre><code>    $VAR1 = {
              &#x27;foo&#x27; => {
                         &#x27;bar&#x27; => {}
                       }
            };</code></pre>
